  "meta": {
    "createdAt": "2026-11-04T00:00:00.000Z",
    "notes": "A rule book for msm_examples:returning_boomerang. The boomerang comes back by itself (after_throw return puts it back in the thrower's inventory when it lands); the rules add what it does on the way: a mob it hits is slowed and glows for a moment, and hitting a block clatters with a few sparks. These rules use only plain steps, so they become ordinary events on the item when exported (no script), in the Fabric mod jar export.",
